<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  The generated launch screen was blank, and Xcode's INFOPLIST_KEY_UILaunchScreen_*
  sub-keys are not honoured in the generated Info.plist: the UILaunchScreen dict
  comes out empty regardless of UIImageName/UIColorName. A storyboard is the
  reliable route, so the first frame the player sees is the civic-arch mark on
  the game's own asphalt ground rather than a white template.
-->
